what is going on everybody welcome back  to the cosmic wonder where we talk all  things marvel and mcu i'm your host  warren thompson and today we have some  really really exciting news about  something that i know a lot of people  have been really wanting to know about  lately and that is the midnight suns in  the mcu it looks like there are some  pretty big developments happening with  the midnight suns with the monster verse  that is clearly being established in the  mcu right now and recently we have  discovered that an actress has been cast  to play a specific midnight sun's  character in the mcu that is going to be  introduced in werewolf by night and this  character has connections to moon knight  which we're watching right now of course  doctor strange and wong which is about  to come up in multiverse madness and  characters like ghostwriter it's looking  like the mcu is setting up the midnight  suns and it looks like today we have  gotten one step closer so let's talk  about this new character that is  reportedly coming to the mcu elsa  bloodstone and who could be on the mcu's  version of the midnight suns slash the  supernatural avengers team and if you're  new and you love marvel be sure to  subscribe so you don't miss out on any  of the latest videos so like i mentioned  today we have a report that says elsa  bloodstone is coming to the mcu and will  be making her debut in werewolf by night  and will be played by laura donnelly now  last january deadline reported that the  never star lord donnelly would be  joining the mcu in werewolf by night  however at the time they said that there  was no official word on the character  that she is going to be playing but they  said that she could potentially be  playing nina price who would become  vampire by night which still would have  been pretty cool but evidently is not  the case today the cosmiccircus.com is  reporting that laura donnelly is going  to be playing elsa bloodstone a monster  hunter in the comics and in the comics  is also a member of one of the midnight  sun's teams and right now it is assumed  that she will not only appear in  werewolf by night but will also continue  to appear in other projects in the mcu  in the future and as we know there are  plenty of supernatural projects coming  up in the mcu in fact at one point in  time it was even rumored that she would  be making an appearance in doctor  strange in the multiverse of madness so  let's talk exactly who elsa bloodstone  is her connection to moon knight doctor  strange and what the midnight sun's mcu  team is currently looking like right now  now as far as the supernatural side of  the mcu goes elsa bloodstone fits right  in now quick origin on elsa bloodstone  her father was ulysses bloodstone and he  sucked he was a monster hunter and  wanted her to be the same and literally  since she was just a baby would have her  fighting monsters for her first kill her  dad made her fight a clippeth but she  took 10 seconds too long to kill it and  its blood got all over her head her dad  commanded her that she leave it on there  to let it get infected as a sign of her  inadequacy needless to say her mom  wasn't too happy about this so her dad  decided that he needed to remove the  mother from the equation so he put her  in contact with some monsters had her  declared mentally insane and put her in  a menstrual institution so needless to  say not a good guy however eventually  with old age he would go on to die and  elsa bloodstone decides that she wants  to be a monster hunter now she is  equipped with the bloodstone or the  blood gem the blood gem was a part of a  meteorite that was sent to earth by the  exomined the blood gem grants elsa a  number of powers the normal ones of  course superhuman strength speed  durability reflexes etc but they also  give her psychic powers and esp in the  case of her father however elsa also has  access to some magical books such as the  darkhold and we know that the darkhold  is going to play a very important role  in doctor strange in the multiverse of  madness she also has access to many  magical artifacts including a  teleportation portal generator so like i  said she fits right into the  supernatural side of the mcu and in the  comics she is a member of the midnight  suns and here's where a lot of mcu  connections come in now some people may  know that there are actually different  versions of the midnight suns in the  comics there are different teams put  together but elsa's team has kind of a  specific connection to upcoming projects  in the mcu right now in the comics  strange gets into a little bit of  trouble so wang decides to help him out  and calls a new midnight sun's team the  new team consisted of blade mr knight  elsa bloodstone dr voodoo man thing iron  fist and ghost writer this is a pretty  exciting team i would love to see this  team in the mcu now one division sort of  kicked off the supernatural side of the  mcu and moon knight is carrying it on  right now and as i mentioned mr knight  who we saw in moon knight episodes 2 and  3 is a part of elsa bloodstone's  midnight sun's team and i'm hoping that  after the end of moon night steven grant  sticks around with mark spector and we  have moon knight and mr knight in the  mcu still now here's kind of the cool  thing about moon knight i know there's  been a lot of talk that moon knight is  almost kind of a one-off thing from  marvel it's not heavily connected to the  mcu although of course it takes place  inside of the mcu we've only really had  a couple of connections to the mcu as a  whole they mentioned mad report and we  have a statue of the black panther god  best but here's kind of the cool thing  about the midnight suns team they're not  really like the avengers they don't kind  of know who each other are kind of have  a little bit of contact with each other  and then come together as a superhero  group to save the day they're all kind  of just brought together to form a quick  team to do a quick job in fact in some  cases some members don't even  necessarily like each other and have  fought before but they come together for  the greater good to save the world and  this kind of works for moon knight  because there isn't too big of an mcu  connection there but there doesn't have  to be doctor strange and wong should be  monitoring everybody now they're going  to have their hands full of multiverse  of madness but their job is to basically  monitor reality protect it and keep tabs  on other super people so i'm sure  they're aware of mr knight and moon  knight and mark specter and steven grant  and anybody else who is hiding in there  jake lockley so as blade gets introduced  into the mcu and other people like  brother voodoo clea werewolf by night  and hopefully ghostwriter pretty soon  doctor strange and or wong can summon  this new team of supernatural avengers  together to fight some supernatural  enemies now there's gonna be a ton of  cameos in doctor strange in the  multiverse of madness but hopefully some  of them stick around and aren't just  variants there's been a rumor going  around for a while that brother voodoo  and clea will be introduced in  multiverse of madness and the reports  aren't that their variants are going to  be introduced but their characters as a  whole are going to be introduced and be  sticking around in the mcu and i am  hoping that some type of variants from  the defenders are going to appear as  well luke cage iron fist maybe some  inhumans the midnight suns team  obviously doesn't have to be exactly  like it was from the comics but if you  take a look at some of the characters  that are in the mcu are coming we  actually have a pretty good lineup so  far of course we would hope that doctor  strange would be a part of it blade of  course maybe even deadpool seen as how  elsa bloodstone has ran into deadpool in  the comics and has even worked together  with him at one point in time we also  have kit harington's the black knight  coming i really really hope mr knight  and moon knight will be a part of it  eventually as well and of course we have  werewolf by night and fingers crossed  that we get ghost rider in the mcu at  some point in time very soon a lot of  casting rumors for ghost rider have been  going on for a pretty long time now and  hopefully some of them are true and we  are indeed getting a ghost rider even if  it is just a variant in multiverse of  madness i'd still love to see him in the  mcu so expect this new supernatural  character elsa bloodstone to appear in  marvel's werewolf by night which is  supposed to come out this october as a  halloween special then hopefully marvel  continues to explore this darker side of  the mcu and we get an official midnight  sun's team slash a supernatural avengers  team so let me know how excited you are  about this in the comments down below  and let me know who you would like to  see on the mcu's midnight suns team  leave your comments down below don't  forget to like the video and subscribe  so you can stay up to date on all the  latest mcu news for live updates you can  follow me on instagram and twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof
 

